   - `const logMessage = `${new Date()} ${req.method} ${req.originalUrl}\n`;`: 
     - This line constructs a string containing the current date/time (`new Date()`), the HTTP method (`req.method`), and the original URL (`req.originalUrl`) of the incoming request.
